y levels and an Auto Matchmaking System.\n\nPlay now the most realistic VR 8 ball pool game! Engage in thrilling matches against AI opponents or connect with friends around the world for a real-time pool face-off.", "short_description": "Welcome to the Christmas 2025 Multiplayer Version of The Game!\n\n- No Micro Transactions, nor Pay to Win.\n- Create your Avatars, modify your Cue and Style. \n- 110,000 Active Users <3 Thank you for Support!\n- Free Trial Play is here, along with new difficulty levels and an Auto Matchmaking System.\n\nPlay now the most realistic VR 8 ball pool game! Engage in thrilling matches against AI opponents or connect with friends around the world for a real-time pool face-off."}]}, "developer_name": "Going Merry LLC", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sharpforks.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://sharpforks.com/term-of-use/", "publisher_name": "Going Merry LLC", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://goingmerry.xyz/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": ["SPORTS", "SOCIAL"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "26875667012035380"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823949_4426189397699306_2508070892376124164_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nAKHLXGOiI0Q7kNvwHr2UEn&_